dseg:0E70 off_42CC0       dd nullsub_1            ; DATA XREF: sub_1E9F6+1D5↑r
dseg:0E74                 dd UpdatePlayerPuckState ; Updates entity state (e.g., player/puck), checks flags, handles timers/movement, calls math/render functions. Core entity update logic.
dseg:0E78                 dd ResetGameState       ; Resets numerous game flags/variables, initalizes arrays, randomizes values, calls setups. Resets game state for new play/period.
dseg:0E7C                 dd UpdatePlayerHorizontalPursuit
dseg:0E80                 dd UpdatePlayerVerticalPursuit ; Similar to above but with vertical focus. Handles flag resets, timer decrements, position randomization from tables (e.g., [di+2F8Ch]), and directional negation. Calls different updater (loc_18CFA). Includes semantic checks for mismatches and entity threading.
dseg:0E84                 dd UpdatePlayerScaledMovement ; Compact variant for state checks and movement. Resets flags, compares attributes, sets flags on mismatch, computes scaled positions (e.g., sar ax,1), and applies negation based on side. Calls generic updater.
dseg:0E88                 dd UpdatePlayerRandomizedPursuit ; Extended pursuit logic with randomization from different tables (e.g., [di+2FACh]). Handles mismatches, position clamping, and calls threaded updater (loc_18CFA). Focuses on entity context and replies.
dseg:0E8C                 dd UpdatePuckCarrierSync ; Puck-related update. Checks if player matches puck carrier, handles timeouts, position syncing (e.g., to word_42C06/word_42C08), and random delays. Calls sub_1CCEC for sound/effect.
dseg:0E90                 dd InitializeRandomPlayerData ; Initializes random values in a loop (e.g., fills 0E70h to 0F70h with _rand), then sets repeated values (e.g., loc_14E97+3 with team/random).
dseg:0E94                 dd TransitionToIdleState ; State transition handler. Resets velocities, positions based on [si+5Eh], sets flags for special modes (e.g., or 20h), and calls sub_1CCEC with team-specific values.
dseg:0E98                 dd ResetPlayerVelocityAndFlags ; State reset and velocity handler. Clears flags, sets positions/velocities (e.g., [si+0Ch]=F000h), calls sub_1CCEC and sub_1CD00 (cleanup?).
dseg:0E9C                 dd UpdatePlayerSemanticState ; Detailed update with semantic searches, flag mismatches, position randomization, and state transitions (e.g., to 20h or 64h timer). Calls sub_1DD14/sub_1DD42 for updates.
dseg:0EA0                 dd HandlePlayerBounceResponse ; Similar collision/movement handler but with different thresholds and flag sets (e.g., or 4, to 20h). Updates velocities and positions, calls sub_1CCEC.
dseg:0EA4                 dd SetPlayerEndStateFlags ; Quick flag setter if not paused. Sets [bx+1Bh] to FFh and [bx+12h] to FFFFh, possibly marking end states.
dseg:0EA8                 dd UpdateAdvancedPlayerAI ; Comprehensive player AI/movement. Handles positions toward puck/goal, random decisions, boundary checks, flag updates (e.g., or 2 for special), and velocity scaling. Calls multiple subroutines for pathing.
dseg:0EAC                 dd DecidePlayerAIAction ; AI decision maker. Checks conditions, decrements timers, random pursuits if thresholds met (e.g., [bx+26h]<E10h), calls movement updaters.
